INSERT INTO `sentence200` (`id`, `sentence`, `chinese`, `create_time`) VALUES (1,'According to a recent survey, four million people die each year from diseases linked to smoking.','依照最近的一项调查，每年有4，000，000人死于与吸烟有关的疾病。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(2,'The latest surveys show that quite a few children have unpleasant associations with homework.','最近的调查显示相当多的孩子对家庭作业没什么好感。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(3,'No invention has received more praise and abuse than Internet.','没有一项发明像互联网一样同时受到如此多的赞扬和批评。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(4,'People seem to fail to take into account the fact that education does not end with graduation.','人们似乎忽视了教育不应该随着毕业而结束这一事实。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(5,'An increasing number of people are beginning to realize that education is not complete with graduation.','越来越多的人开始意识到教育不能随着毕业而结束。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(6,'When it comes to education, the majority of people believe that education is a lifetime study.','说到教育，大部分人认为其是一个终生的学习。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(7,'Many experts point out that physical exercise contributes directly to a person\'s physical fitness.','许多专家指出体育锻炼直接有助于身体健康。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(8,'Proper measures must be taken to limit the number of foreign tourists and the great efforts should be made to protect local environment and history from the harmful effects of international tourism.','应该采取适当的措施限制外国旅游者的数量，努力保护当地环境和历史不受国际旅游业的不利影响。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(9,'An increasing number of experts believe that migrants will exert positive effects on construction of city. However, this opinion is now being questioned by more and more city residents, who complain that the migrants have brought many serious problems like crime and prostitution.','越来越多的专家相信移民对城市的建设起到积极作用。然而，越来越多的城市居民却怀疑这种说法，他们抱怨民工给城市带来了许多严重的问题，像犯罪和卖淫。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(10,'Many city residents complain that it is so few buses in their city that they have to spend much more time waiting for a bus, which is usually crowded with a large number of passengers.','许多市民抱怨城市的公交车太少，以至于他们要花很长时间等一辆公交车，而车上可能已满载乘客。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(11,'There is no denying the fact that air pollution is an extremely serious problem: the city authorities should take strong measures to deal with it.','无可否认，空气污染是一个极其严重的问题：城市当局应该采取有力措施来解决它。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(12,'An investigation shows that female workers tend to have a favorable attitude toward retirement.','一项调查显示妇女欢迎退休。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(13,'A proper part-time job does not occupy students\' too much time. In fact, it is unhealthy for them to spend all of time on their study. As an old saying goes: All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.','一份适当的业余工作并不会占用学生太多的时间，事实上，把全部的时间都用到学习上并不健康，正如那句老话：只工作，不玩耍，聪明的孩子会变傻。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(14,'Any government, which is blind to this point, may pay a heavy price.','任何政府忽视这一点都将付出巨大的代价。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(15,'Nowadays, many students always go into raptures at the mere mention of the coming life of high school or college they will begin. Unfortunately, for most young people, it is not pleasant experience on their first day on campus.','当前，一提到即将开始的学校生活，许多学生都会兴高采烈。然而，对多数年轻人来说，校园刚开始的日子并不是什么愉快的经历。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(16,'In view of the seriousness of this problem, effective measures should be taken before things get worse.','考虑到问题的严重性，在事态进一步恶化之前，必须采取有效的措施。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(17,'The majority of students believe that part-time job will provide them with more opportunities to develop their interpersonal skills, which may put them in a favorable position in the future job markets.','大部分学生相信业余工作会使他们有更多机会发展人际交往能力，而这对他们未来找工作是非常有好处的。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(18,'It is indisputable that there are millions of people who still have a miserable life and have to face the dangers of starvation and exposure.','无可争辩，现在有成千上万的人仍过着挨饿受冻的痛苦生活。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(19,'Although this view is wildly held, this is little evidence that education can be obtained at any age and at any place.','尽管这一观点被广泛接受，很少有证据表明教育能够在任何地点、任何年龄进行。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(20,'No one can deny the fact that a person\'s education is the most important aspect of his life.','没有人能否认：教育是人生最重要的一方面。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(21,'People equate success in life with the ability of operating computer.','人们把会使用计算机与人生成功相提并论。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(22,'In the last decades, advances in medical technology have made it possible for people to live longer than in the past.','在过去的几十年，先进的医疗技术已经使得人们比过去活的时间更长成为可能。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(23,'In fact, we have to admit the fact that the quality of life is as important as life itself.','事实上，我们必须承认生命的质量和生命本身一样重要。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(24,'We should spare no effort to beautify our environment.','我们应该不遗余力地美化我们的环境。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(25,'People believe that computer skills will enhance their job opportunities or promotion opportunities.','人们相信拥有计算机技术可以获得更多工作或提升的机会。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(26,'The information I\'ve collected over last few years leads me to believe that this knowledge may be less useful than most people think.','从这几年我搜集的信息来看，这些知识并没有人们想象的那么有用。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(27,'Now, it is generally accepted that no college or university can educate its students by the time they graduation.','现在，人们普遍认为没有一所大学能够在毕业时候教给学生所有的知识。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(28,'This is a matter of life and death--a matter no country can afford to ignore.','这是一个关系到生死的问题，任何国家都不能忽视。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(29,'For my part, I agree with the latter opinion for the following reasons:','就我而言，我同意后者，有如下理由：','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(30,'Before giving my opinion, I think it is important to look at the arguments on both sides.','在给出我的观点之前，我想看看双方的观点是重要的。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(31,'This view is now being questioned by more and more people.','这一观点正受到越来越多人的质疑。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(32,'Although many people claim that, along with the rapidly economic development, the numbers of people who use bicycle are decreasing and bicycle is bound to die out. The information I\'ve collected over the recent years leads me to believe that bicycle will continue to play extremely important roles in modern society.','尽管许多人认为随着经济的高速发展，用自行车的人数会减少，自行车可能会消亡，然而，这几年我收集的一些信息让我相信自行车仍然会继续在现代社会发挥极其重要的作用。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(33,'Environmental experts point out that increasing pollution not only causes serious problems such as global warming but also could threaten to end human life on our planet.','环境学家指出：持续增加的污染不仅会导致像全球变暖这样严重的问题，而且还将威胁到人类在这个星球的生存。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(34,'In view of such serious situation, environmental tools of transportation like bicycle are more important than any time before.','考虑到这些严重的状况，我们比以往任何时候更需要像自行车这样的环保型交通工具。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(35,'Using bicycle contributes greatly to people\'s physical fitness as well as easing traffic jams.','使用自行车有助于人们的身体健康，并极大地缓解了交通阻塞。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(36,'Despite many obvious advantages of bicycle, it is not without its problem.','尽管自行车有许多明显的优点，但是它也存在它的问题。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(37,'Bicycle can\'t be compared with other means of transportation like car and train for speed and comfort.','在速度和舒适度方面，自行车是无法和汽车、火车这样的交通工具相比的。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(38,'From what has been discussed above, we may safely draw the conclusion that advantages of bicycle far outweigh its disadvantages and it will still play essential roles in modern society.','通过以上讨论，我们可以得出结论：自行车的优点远大于缺点，并且在现代社会它仍将发挥重要作用。','2025-11-18 16:22:15'),(39,'There is a general discussion these days over education in many colleges and institutes. One of the questions under debate is whether education is a lifetime study.','当前在高校和研究机构对教育存在着大量争论，其中一个问题就是教育是否是个终身学习的过程。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(40,'This issue has caused wide public concern.','这个问题已经引起了广泛关注。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(41,'It must be noted that learning must be done by a person himself.','必须指出学习只能靠自己。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(42,'A large number of people tend to live under the illusion that they had completed their education when they finished their schooling. Obviously, they seem to fail to take into account the basic fact that a person\'s education is a most important aspect of his life.','许多人存在这样的误解，认为离开学校就意味着结束了他们的教育。显然，他们忽视了教育是人生重要部分这一基本事实。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(43,'As for me, I\'m in favor of the opinion that education is not complete with graduation, for the following reasons:','就我而言，我同意教育不应该随着毕业而结束的观点，有以下原因：','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(44,'It is commonly accepted that no college or university can educate its students by the time they graduate.','人们普遍认为高校是不可能在毕业的时候教会他们的学生所有知识的。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(45,'Even the best possible graduate needs to continue learning before she or he becomes an educated person.','即使最优秀的毕业生，要想成为一个博学的人也要不断地学习。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(46,'It is commonly thought that our society had dramatically changed by modern science and technology, and human had made extraordinary progress in knowledge and technology over the recent decades.','人们普遍认为我们的现代科技使我们的社会发生了巨大的变化，近几十年人类在科技方面取得了惊人的进步。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(47,'Now people in growing numbers are beginning to believe that learning new skills and knowledge contributes directly to enhancing their job opportunities or promotion opportunities.','现在越来越多的人开始相信学习新的技术和知识能直接帮助他们获得工作就会或提升的机会。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(48,'An investigation shows that many older people express a strong desire to continue studying in university or college.','一项调查显示许多老人都有到大学继续学习的愿望。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(49,'For the majority of people, reading or learning a new skill has become the focus of their lives and the source of their happiness and contentment after their retirement.','对大多数人来讲，退休以后，阅读或学习一项新技术已成为他们生活的中心和快乐的来源。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(50,'For people who want to adopt a healthy and meaningful life style, it is important to find time to learn certain new knowledge. Just as an old saying goes: it is never too late to learn.','对于那些想过上健康而有意义的生活的人们来说，找时间学习一些新知识是很重要的，正如那句老话：活到老，学到老。','2025-11-18 16:22:16'),(51,'There is a general debate on the campus today over the phenomenon of college or high school students\' doing a part-time job.','对于大学或高中生打工这一现象，校园里进行着广泛的争论。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(52,'By taking a major-related part-job, students can not only improve their academic studies, but gain much experience, experience they will never be able to get from the textbooks.','通过做一份和专业相关的工作，学生不仅能够提高他们的专业能力，而且能获得从课本上得不到的经验。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(53,'Although people\'s lives have been dramatically changed over the last decades, it must be admitted that, shortage of funds is still the one of the biggest questions that students nowadays have to face because that tuition fees and prices of books are soaring by the day.','近几十年，尽管人们的生活有了惊人的改变，但必须承认，由于学费和书费日益飞涨，资金短缺仍然是学生们面临的最大问题之一。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(54,'Consequently, the extra money obtained from part-time job will strongly support students to continue to their study life.','因此，业余工作挣来的钱将强有力地支持学生们继续他们的求学生活。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(55,'From what has been discussed above, we may safely draw a conclusion that part-time job can produce a far-reaching impact on students and they should be encouraged to take part-time job, which will benefit students and their family, even the society as a whole.','通过上面的讨论，我们不难得出结论：业余工作对学生们会产生深远的影响，我们应鼓励学生从事业余工作，这将有利于学生和他们的家庭，甚至整个社会。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(56,'These days, people in growing numbers are beginning to complain that work is more stressful and less leisurely than in past. Many experts point out that, along with the development of modern society, it is an inevitable result and there is no way to avoid it.','现在，越来越多的人们开始抱怨工作比以前更有压力。许多专家指出这是现代社会发展必然的结果，无法避免。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(57,'It is widely acknowledged that computer and other machines have become an indispensable part of our society, which make our life and work more comfortable and less laborious.','人们普遍认为计算机和其他机器已经成为我们社会必不可少的一部分。它们使我们的生活更舒适，减少了大量劳动。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(58,'At the same time, along with the benefits of such machines, employees must study knowledge involved in such machines so that they are able to control them.','同时，随着这些机器带给我们的好处，员工们也必须要学习与之相关的知识以便使用它们。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(59,'No one can deny the basic fact that it is impossible for average workers to master those high-technology skills easily.','没有人能否认这一基本事实：对于一般工人来讲，轻松掌握这些技术是不可能的。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(60,'In the second place, there seem to be too many people without job and not enough job position.','第二方面，失业的人似乎太多而又没有足够的工作岗位。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(61,'Millions of people have to spend more time and energy on studying new skills and technology so that they can keep a favorable position in job market.','成千上万的人们不得不花费更多的精力和时间学习新的技术和知识，使得他们在就业市场能保持优势。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(62,'According to a recent survey, a growing number of people express a strong desire to take another job or spend more time on their job in order to get more money to support their family.','根据最近的一项调查，越来越多的人表达了想从事另外的工作或加班以赚取更多的钱来补贴家用的强烈愿望。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(63,'From what has been discussed above, I am fully convinced that the leisure life-style is undergoing a decline with the progress of modern society, it is not necessary a bad thing.','通过以上讨论，我完全相信，随着现代社会的进步，幽闲的生活方式正在消失并不是件坏事。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(64,'The problem of international tourism has caused wide public concern over the recent years.','近些年，国际旅游的问题引起了广泛关注。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(65,'Many people believe that international tourism produce positive effects on economic growth and local government should be encouraged to promote international tourism.','许多人认为国际旅游对经济发展有积极作用，应鼓励地方政府发展国际旅游。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(66,'But what these people fail to see is that international tourism may bring about a disastrous impact on our environment and local history.','但是这些人忽视了国际旅游可能会给当地环境和历史造成的灾难性的影响。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(67,'As for me, I\'m firmly convinced that the number of foreign tourists should be limited, for the following reasons:','就我而言，我坚定地认为国外旅游者的数量应得到限制，理由如下：','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(68,'In addition, in order to attract tourists, a lot of artificial facilities have been built, which have certain unfavorable effects on the environment.','另外，为了吸引旅游者，大量人工设施被修建，这对环境是不利的。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(69,'For lack of distinct culture, some places will not attract tourists any more. Consequently, the fast rise in number of foreign tourists may eventually lead to the decline of local tourism.','由于缺乏独特的文化，一些地方不再吸引旅游者。因此，国外旅游者数量的快速增加可能最终会导致当地旅游业的衰败。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(70,'There is a growing tendency for parents to ask their children to accept extra educational programs over the recent years.','近些年，父母要求他们的孩子接受额外的教育呈增长的势头。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(71,'This phenomenon has caused wide public concern in many places of world.','这一现象在全世界许多地方已引起了广泛关注。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(72,'Many parents believe that additional educational activities enjoy obvious advantage. By extra studies, they maintain, their children are able to obtain many kinds of practical skills and useful knowledge, which will put them in a beneficial position in the future job markets when they grow up.','许多家长相信额外的教育活动有许多优点，通过学习，他们的孩子可以获得很多实践技能和有用的知识，当他们长大后，这些对他们就业是大有好处的。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(73,'In the first place, extra studies bring about unhealthy impacts on physical growth of children. Educational experts point out that, it is equally important to take some sport activities instead of extra studies when children have spent the whole day in a boring classroom.','首先，额外的学习对孩子们的身体发育是不利的。教育专家指出，孩子们在枯燥的教室里呆了一整天后，从事一些体育活动，而不是额外的学习，是非常重要的。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(74,'Children are undergoing fast physical development; lack of physical exercise may produce disastrous influence on their later life.','孩子们正处于身体快速发育时期，缺乏体育锻炼可能会对他们未来的生活造成严重的影响。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(75,'In the second place, from psychological aspect, the majority of children seem to tend to have an unfavorable attitude toward additional educational activities.','第二，从心理上讲，大部分孩子似乎对额外的学习没有什么好感。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(76,'It is hard to imagine a student focusing their energy on textbook while other children are playing.','当别的孩子在玩耍的时候，很难想象一个学生能集中精力在课本上。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(77,'Moreover, children will have less time to play and communicate with their peers due to extra studies, consequently, it is difficult to develop and cultivate their character and interpersonal skills. They may become more solitary and even suffer from certain mental illness.','而且，由于要额外地学习，孩子们没有多少时间和同龄的孩子玩耍和交流，很难培养他们的个性和交际能力。他们可能变得孤僻甚至产生某些心理疾病。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(78,'From what has been discussed above, we may safely draw the conclusion that, although extra studies indeed enjoy many obvious advantages, its disadvantages shouldn\'t be ignored and far outweigh its advantages. It is absurd to force children to take extra studies after school.','通过以上讨论，我们可以得出结论：尽管额外学习的确有很多优点，但它的缺点不可忽视，且远大于它的优点。因此，放学后强迫孩子额外学习是不明智的。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(79,'Any parents should place considerable emphasis on their children to keep the balance between play and study. As an old saying goes: All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.','任何家长都应非常重视保持孩子学习与玩耍的平衡，正如那句老话：只工作，不玩耍，聪明的孩子会变傻。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(80,'There is a growing tendency for parent these days to stay at home to look after their children instead of returning to work earlier.','现在，父母亲留在家里照顾孩子而不愿过早返回工作岗位正成为增加的趋势。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(81,'Parents are firmly convinced that, to send their child to kindergartens or nursery schools will have an unfavorable influence on the growth of children.','父母们坚定地相信把孩子送到幼儿园对他们的成长不利。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(82,'However, this idea is now being questioned by more and more experts, who point out that it is unhealthy for children who always stay with their parents at home.','然而，这一想法正遭受越来越多的专家的质疑，他们指出，孩子总是呆在家里，和父母在一起，是不健康的。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(83,'Although parent would be able to devote much more time and energy to their children, it must be admitted that, parent has less experience and knowledge about how to educate and supervise children, when compared with professional teachers working in kindergartens or nursery schools.','尽管父母能在他们孩子身上投入更多时间和精力，但是必须承认，与工作在幼儿园的专职教师相比，他们在如何管理教育孩子方面缺乏知识和经验。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(84,'From what has been discussed above, we may safely draw a conclusion that, although the parents\' desire to look after children by themselves is understandable, its disadvantages far outweigh the advantages.','通过以上讨论，我们可以得出结论：尽管家长想亲自照看孩子的愿望是可以理解的，但是这样做的缺点远大于优点。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(85,'Parents should be encouraged to send their children to nursery schools, which will bring about profound impacts on children and families, and even the society as a whole.','应该鼓励父母将他们的孩子送到幼儿园，这将对孩子，家庭，甚至整个社会产生深远的影响。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(86,'Many leaders of government always go into raptures at the mere mention of artistic and cultural projects. They are forever talking about the nice parks, the smart sculptures in central city and the art galleries with various valuable rarities. Nothing, they maintain, is more essential than such projects in the economic growth.','只要一提起艺术和文化项目，一些政府领导就会兴奋不已，他们滔滔不绝地说着美丽的公园，城市中心漂亮的雕塑，还有满是稀世珍宝的艺术展览馆。他们认为在经济发展中，没有什么比这些艺术项目更重要了。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(87,'But is it really the case? The information I\'ve collected over last few years leads me to believe that artistic and cultural projects may be less useful than many governments think. In fact, basic infrastructure projects are playing extremely important role and should be given priority.','这是真的吗？这些年我收集的信息让我相信这些文化、艺术项目并没有许多政府想象的那么重要。事实上，基础设施建设非常重要，应该放在首位。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(88,'Those who are in favor of artistic and cultural projects advocate that cultural environment will attract more tourists, which will bring huge profits to local residents. Some people even equate the build of such projects with the improving of economic construction.','那些赞成建设文化艺术项目的人认为文化环境会吸引更多的游客，这将给当地居民带来巨大的利益。一些人甚至把建设文化艺术项目与发展经济建设等同起来。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(89,'Unfortunately, there is very few evidence that big companies are willing to invest a huge sums of money in a place without sufficient basic projects, such as supplies of electricity and water.','然而，很少有证据表明大公司愿意把巨额的资金投到一个连水电这些基础设施都不完善的地方去。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(90,'From what has been discussed above, it would be reasonable to believe that basic projects play far more important role than artistic and cultural projects in people\'s life and economic growth.','通过以上讨论，我们有理由相信在人们的生活和经济发展方面，基础建设比艺术文化项目发挥更大的作用。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(91,'Those urban planners who are blind to this point will pay a heavy price, which they cannot afford it.','那些城市的规划者们如果忽视这一点，将会付出他们无法承受的代价。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(92,'There is a growing tendency these days for many people who live in rural areas to come into and work in city. This problem has caused wide public concern in most cities all over the world.','农民进城打工正成为增长的趋势，这一问题在世界上大部分城市已引起普遍关注。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(93,'An investigation shows that many emigrants think that working at city provide them with not only a higher salary but also the opportunity of learning new skills.','一项调查显示许多民工认为在城市打工不仅有较高的收入，而且能学到一些新技术。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(94,'It must be noted that improvement in agriculture seems to not be able to catch up with the increase in population of rural areas and there are millions of peasants who still live a miserable life and have to face the dangers of exposure and starvation.','必须指出，农业的发展似乎赶不上农村人口的增加，并且仍有成千上万的农民过着缺衣挨饿的贫寒生活。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(95,'Although rural emigrants contribute greatly to the economic growth of the cities, they may inevitably bring about many negative impacts.','尽管民工对城市的经济发展做出了巨大贡献，然而他们也不可避免的带来了一些负面影响。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(96,'Many sociologists point out that rural emigrants are putting pressure on population control and social order; that they are threatening to take already scarce city jobs; and that they have worsened traffic and public health problems.','许多社会学家指出民工正给人口控制和社会治安带来压力。他们正在威胁着本已萧条的工作市场，他们恶化了交通和公共卫生状况。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(97,'It is suggested that governments ought to make efforts to reduce the increasing gap between cities and countryside. They ought to set aside an appropriate fund for improvement of the standard of peasants\' lives. They ought to invite some experts in agriculture to share their experiences, information and knowledge with peasants, which will contribute directly to the economic growth of rural areas.','建议政府应该努力减少正在拉大的城乡差距。应该划拨适当的资金提高农民的生活水平；应该邀请农业专家向农民介绍他们的经验，知识和信息，这些将有助于发展农村经济。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(98,'In conclusion, we must take into account this problem rationally and place more emphases on peasants\' lives. Any government that is blind to this point will pay a heavy price.','总之，我们应理智考虑这一问题，重视农民的生活。任何政府忽视这一点都将付出巨大的代价。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(99,'Although many experts from universities and institutes consistently maintain that it is an inevitable part of an independent life, parents in growing numbers are starting to realize that people, including teachers and experts in education, should pay considerable attention to this problem.','尽管来自高校和研究院的许多专家坚持认为这是独立生活不可避免的一部分，然而越来越多的家长开始意识到包括教师和教育专家在内的人该认真对待这一问题。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(100,'As for me, it is essential to know, at first, what kind of problems young students possible would encounter on campus.','我认为，首先应看看学生们在校园可能遇到哪些问题。','2025-11-18 16:26:48'),(101,'In the first place, living independently requires that the young student know a little bit about the law, consumer protection, and other aspects of daily life.','首先，独立生活要求年轻学生了解一些法律、消费者保护和日常生活其他方面知识。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(102,'Without some basic knowledge about these fields, young students may have no idea about forming their rights and responsibilities.','如果缺乏这些领域的基本知识，年轻学生可能无法形成自己的权利和责任意识。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(103,'In the second place, those young people are less experienced in interpersonal relations after being so long at parents\' care.','其次，这些年轻人在父母的长期照顾下，缺乏人际关系方面的经验。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(104,'Consequently, after they step into society, they may easily feel upset or even suffer from mental breakdown.','因此，当他们踏入社会后，很容易感到沮丧，甚至可能遭受精神崩溃。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(105,'Given the reasons listed above, it is necessary that young students increase the knowledge of law and safety and strengthen the awareness of self-protection before their arrival on campus.','鉴于上述原因，在入学前，年轻学生有必要增加法律和安全知识，强化自我保护意识。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(106,'On the other hand, young students should be encouraged to take part-time jobs in their holidays to gain more social experience.','另一方面，应该鼓励年轻学生在假期从事兼职工作，以获得更多社会经验。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(107,'There is a discussion in an academic conference what kinds of professors are more qualified for universities.','在一个学术会议上，人们正在讨论什么样的教授更适合大学。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(108,'During my four-year study in university, I have seen many qualified professors and also talked to many famous professors in other colleges or institutes.','在我四年的大学学习中，我见过许多合格的教授，也与其他院校的许多著名教授交谈过。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(109,'As far as I am concerned, a college professor should have three qualities which are essential to his success.','就我而言，大学教授应该具备三个对其成功至关重要的品质。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(110,'First, a qualified professor must be very knowledgeable in his field.','首先，一位合格的教授必须在自己的领域知识渊博。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(111,'It is said that, a man can succeed only when he knows exactly what he wants to be. Similarly, a successful professor must be proficient in a certain academic field so that his students can benefit a great deal from his knowledge.','据说，一个人只有清楚地知道自己想成为什么，才能成功。同样，一位成功的教授必须精通某一学术领域，这样他的学生才能从他的知识中获益匪浅。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(112,'Secondly, a qualified professor should be open-minded and accessible, which is helpful to academic exchange and research.','其次，一位合格的教授应该思想开明且平易近人，这有助于学术交流和研究。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(113,'I remember one of my teachers, he neither accepted the students\' real and honest questions nor liked his teaching way to be doubted by students.','我记得我的一位老师，他既不接受学生真实而诚实的问题，也不喜欢他的教学方式被学生质疑。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(114,'As a result, his students did not like his class and became lazy and indolent to his subject; however, he was quite satisfied with himself and his students\' performance in his class.','结果，他的学生不喜欢他的课，对他的科目变得懒惰和懈怠；然而，他对自己的表现和学生在课堂上的表现很满意。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(115,'He was absolutely a qualified professor for his job.','他绝对不是一位称职的教授。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(116,'Thirdly, a qualified professor should have a global outlook and should maintain at the forefront of academic development in his specialized field.','第三，一位合格的教授应该具有全球视野，并且应该在其专业领域保持学术发展的前沿。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(117,'An outlook can help the professor to have the right teaching objective and to instruct his students to take correct road in their personal and academic life, but always keeping academic development in mind could make students not fall behind the time.','全球视野可以帮助教授拥有正确的教学目标，指导学生在个人和学术生活中走上正确的道路，而始终关注学术发展可以让学生不落后于时代。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(118,'No one can deny the basic fact that most important qualities of college professors directly or indirectly determine a student\'s academic future.','没有人能否认这样一个基本事实：大学教授最重要的品质直接或间接地决定了学生的学术未来。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(119,'There is a growing concern over cheating in examinations.','人们对考试作弊现象越来越关注。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(120,'Many people maintain that cheating in examinations does great harm not only to the students themselves but also to the society.','许多人认为，考试作弊不仅对学生本人，而且对社会都造成了很大的伤害。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(121,'Others, however, take a different attitude. They claim that some kinds of cheating are inevitable and even necessary in their college life and future career.','然而，其他人持不同态度。他们声称，在大学生活和未来职业生涯中，某些类型的作弊是不可避免的，甚至是必要的。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(122,'As far as I am concerned, I firmly believe that the harmfulness of cheating in examinations far outweighs the possible benefits of that.','就我而言，我坚信考试作弊的危害远远大于可能的好处。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(123,'Cheating, to my understanding, can be classified into two categories. The first is to cheat in the exam to get high scores, while the second is to cheat in research work or papers.','在我看来，作弊可以分为两类。第一类是在考试中作弊以获得高分，第二类是在研究工作或论文中作弊。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(124,'No one can deny the fact that the purpose of an exam is to test the knowledge of students and help them to understand what they have and have not mastered.','没有人能否认这样一个事实：考试的目的是测试学生的知识，帮助他们了解自己掌握和未掌握的内容。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(125,'If someone cheats in an exam, he or she is just deceiving himself as well as his or her teachers.','如果有人在考试中作弊，他或她只是在欺骗自己和老师。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(126,'From this point of view, a student who cheats in an exam may get a high score, but in fact, he or she has not benefited from this.','从这个角度看，在考试中作弊的学生可能会获得高分，但实际上，他或她并没有从中受益。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(127,'What\'s worse, such cheating may hinder students from working hard to grasp knowledge and may do great harm to their habit of study, even their whole life.','更糟糕的是，这种作弊可能会阻碍学生努力掌握知识，可能会对他们的学习习惯，甚至整个人生产生巨大伤害。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(128,'From my point of view, cheating in exams and in academic research cannot only lead to the loss of knowledge for the students, but also do harm to the academic atmosphere of the university.','在我看来，考试和学术研究中的作弊不仅会导致学生知识的流失，还会损害大学的学术氛围。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(129,'What\'s more, if students cheat in their exams or papers in their college, they may form a bad habit which may follow them into their future career and do harm to the development of our society.','而且，如果学生在大学考试或论文中作弊，他们可能会养成坏习惯，这种习惯可能会伴随他们进入未来的职业生涯，并损害我们社会的发展。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(130,'We often notice that, nowadays, many students in our college spend a lot of time on computer games and ignore their studies.','我们经常注意到，如今，我们大学的许多学生花大量时间玩电脑游戏，而忽视了学习。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(131,'It is time that something should be done to deal with this problem.','是时候采取措施来解决这个问题了。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(132,'There are several possible reasons accounting for this phenomenon.','这种现象有几个可能的原因。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(133,'First of all, students in lower grades usually have less self-discipline. They are not fully aware of the importance of study and just want to enjoy the freedom of college life.','首先，低年级的学生通常自律性较差。他们没有充分认识到学习的重要性，只想享受大学生活的自由。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(134,'Secondly, computer games are so attractive that they can easily draw students\' attention away from their study.','其次，电脑游戏太吸引人了，它们很容易把学生的注意力从学习上转移开。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(135,'Moreover, in some cases, the teaching methods of some teachers are somewhat outdated, and cannot stimulate students\' interest in learning.','此外，在某些情况下，一些老师的教学方法有些过时，不能激发学生的学习兴趣。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(136,'From the above analysis, we can come to a conclusion that students\' addiction to computer games has a negative influence on their studies.','从上述分析，我们可以得出结论，学生对电脑游戏的沉迷对他们的学习有负面影响。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(137,'Therefore, effective measures should be taken to help students get rid of the bad habit and make better use of computers.','因此，应该采取有效措施，帮助学生改掉这个坏习惯，更好地利用电脑。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(138,'In my opinion, students should be advised to control the amount of time they spend on playing computer games and use computers for more meaningful purposes such as searching for information and learning new knowledge.','在我看来，应该建议学生控制玩电脑游戏的时间，将电脑用于更有意义的目的，如搜索信息和学习新知识。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(139,'As for teachers, they should adopt more interesting and interactive teaching methods to make their classes more attractive.','至于老师，他们应该采用更有趣、更互动的教学方法，使他们的课堂更有吸引力。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(140,'In addition, school authorities should strengthen the management of computer centers and Internet bars on campus, and organize more beneficial extracurricular activities to enrich students\' campus life.','此外，学校管理部门应加强对校园内电脑中心和网吧的管理，组织更多有益的课外活动，丰富学生的校园生活。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(141,'In today\'s society, many people choose to eat out rather than cook at home.','在当今社会，许多人选择外出就餐而不是在家做饭。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(142,'There are several reasons for this phenomenon, but in general, I think there are three main reasons.','这种现象有几个原因，但总的来说，我认为有三个主要原因。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(143,'First of all, with the development of modern society, people are becoming busier and busier.','首先，随着现代社会的发展，人们变得越来越忙。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(144,'Many people, especially those living in big cities, have to spend a lot of time on their work and daily commute. They simply don\'t have enough time to cook at home.','许多人，尤其是那些住在大城市的人，不得不花很多时间在工作和日常通勤上。他们根本没有足够的时间在家做饭。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(145,'Secondly, eating out provides people with the opportunity to taste various kinds of food without the bother of cooking, cleaning and other household chores.','其次，外出就餐使人们有机会品尝各种食物，而不必费心做饭、清洁和其他家务。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(146,'Moreover, restaurants today offer not only delicious food but also convenient services, some of which even provide take-away and home delivery services.','而且，今天的餐厅不仅提供美味的食物，还提供便捷的服务，其中一些甚至提供外卖和送餐服务。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(147,'Thirdly, for many people, eating out has become not just a way to satisfy hunger, but also a means of socializing and entertainment.','第三，对许多人来说，外出就餐已不仅仅是满足饥饿的方式，也是社交和娱乐的手段。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(148,'People often choose to have dinners with friends or business partners in restaurants to strengthen their relationships or close business deals.','人们经常选择在餐馆与朋友或商业伙伴共进晚餐，以加强关系或达成商业交易。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(149,'There is no doubt that eating out brings great convenience to our life, especially for those who are busy with work.','毫无疑问，外出就餐给我们的生活带来了极大的便利，尤其是对那些工作繁忙的人来说。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(150,'However, we should also be aware of the potential problems caused by eating out too frequently, such as food safety issues, unbalanced nutrition, and high expenses.','然而，我们也应该注意过于频繁外出就餐可能带来的潜在问题，如食品安全问题、营养不均衡和高消费。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(151,'In addition, when people eat out too often, they tend to consume more high-calorie, high-fat foods, which may lead to health problems like obesity and heart disease.','此外，当人们外出就餐过于频繁时，他们倾向于摄入更多高热量、高脂肪的食物，这可能导致肥胖和心脏病等健康问题。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(152,'Therefore, we should maintain a reasonable balance between eating out and cooking at home, so as to enjoy the convenience of eating out while keeping our health and financial situation in good condition.','因此，我们应该在外出就餐和在家做饭之间保持合理的平衡，以便享受外出就餐的便利，同时保持我们的健康和财务状况良好。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(153,'With the rapid development of information technology, more and more people are using the Internet for various purposes.','随着信息技术的快速发展，越来越多的人使用互联网用于各种目的。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(154,'The Internet has become an indispensable part of our daily life, which has brought great convenience to us.','互联网已成为我们日常生活中不可或缺的一部分，给我们带来了极大的便利。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(155,'However, some people, especially parents and teachers, are concerned about the negative influence of the Internet on teenagers.','然而，一些人，尤其是父母和老师，担心互联网对青少年的负面影响。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(156,'They worry that teenagers may become addicted to the Internet, especially online games, and neglect their studies and real-life communication.','他们担心青少年可能会沉迷于互联网，尤其是网络游戏，忽视学习和现实生活中的交流。','2025-11-18 16:40:58'),(157,'Some even claim that the Internet has done more harm than good to teenagers.','有些人甚至声称互联网对青少年的害处大于益处。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(158,'But in my opinion, the Internet itself is neither good nor bad; it all depends on how we use it.','但在我看来，互联网本身既不好也不坏；这完全取决于我们如何使用它。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(159,'Actually, the Internet can be a powerful tool for teenagers if they use it properly.','实际上，如果青少年正确使用互联网，它可以成为一种强大的工具。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(160,'For example, with the help of the Internet, teenagers can have access to a wealth of information and knowledge, which can greatly broaden their horizons and enrich their knowledge.','例如，在互联网的帮助下，青少年可以获得大量信息和知识，这可以极大地拓宽他们的视野，丰富他们的知识。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(161,'They can also communicate with people from different parts of the world and learn about different cultures, which is beneficial to their personal growth.','他们还可以与来自世界不同地区的人交流，了解不同的文化，这对他们的个人成长有益。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(162,'Moreover, many educational websites and online courses are available on the Internet, which can help teenagers with their studies.','此外，互联网上有许多教育网站和在线课程，可以帮助青少年学习。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(163,'Of course, we cannot ignore the negative aspects of the Internet.','当然，我们不能忽视互联网的负面影响。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(164,'Some teenagers do become addicted to online games or spend too much time on social media, which may affect their studies and physical health.','一些青少年确实会沉迷于网络游戏或在社交媒体上花费太多时间，这可能会影响他们的学习和身体健康。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(165,'Some even fall victim to online fraud or are exposed to inappropriate content.','有些人甚至成为网络诈骗的受害者或接触到不适当的内容。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(166,'However, these problems are not caused by the Internet itself, but by the improper use of it.','然而，这些问题不是由互联网本身引起的，而是由不当使用它所致。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(167,'Therefore, instead of blaming the Internet, we should teach teenagers how to use it wisely and responsibly.','因此，与其责怪互联网，不如教导青少年如何明智和负责任地使用它。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(168,'Parents and teachers should guide teenagers to use the Internet for positive purposes, such as learning and communicating with others in a healthy way.','父母和老师应该引导青少年将互联网用于积极的目的，如学习和以健康的方式与他人交流。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(169,'At the same time, teenagers themselves should develop self-discipline and learn to control their time spent on the Internet.','同时，青少年自己应该培养自律能力，学会控制自己花在互联网上的时间。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(170,'In conclusion, the Internet is a double-edged sword for teenagers. It can be either beneficial or harmful, depending on how it is used. With proper guidance and self-discipline, teenagers can make the best use of the Internet and avoid its negative effects.','总之，互联网对青少年来说是一把双刃剑。它既有益处也有害处，取决于如何使用它。在适当的指导和自律下，青少年可以充分利用互联网，避免其负面影响。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(171,'In recent years, there has been an increasing concern about the pressure modern people are facing.','近年来，人们越来越关注现代人面临的压力。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(172,'Many people today are suffering from various kinds of pressure, such as work pressure, study pressure, and financial pressure.','如今，许多人正遭受各种压力，如工作压力、学习压力和财务压力。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(173,'Some even suffer from serious mental health problems like depression and anxiety disorder due to excessive pressure.','有些人甚至因压力过大而患有抑郁症和焦虑症等严重的心理健康问题。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(174,'Therefore, it is important for us to learn how to deal with pressure properly.','因此，学会如何正确应对压力对我们来说很重要。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(175,'First of all, we should have a correct attitude toward pressure. Pressure is a normal part of life, and a moderate amount of pressure can actually be beneficial as it can motivate us to work harder and improve ourselves.','首先，我们应该对压力有正确的态度。压力是生活的正常部分，适量的压力实际上是有益的，因为它可以激励我们更加努力工作和提高自己。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(176,'However, when pressure becomes too much, it can have negative effects on our physical and mental health.','然而，当压力过大时，它会对我们的身心健康产生负面影响。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(177,'Therefore, we need to find effective ways to relieve pressure.','因此，我们需要找到有效的减压方法。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(178,'One effective way is to maintain a healthy lifestyle, which includes regular exercise, balanced diet, and sufficient sleep. Exercise, in particular, can help release tension and improve our mood.','一种有效的方法是保持健康的生活方式，包括定期锻炼、均衡饮食和充足的睡眠。特别是锻炼可以帮助释放紧张情绪，改善我们的心情。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(179,'Another way is to develop hobbies and interests outside of work or study. Doing things we enjoy can help us relax and take our minds off pressure.','另一种方法是在工作或学习之外培养爱好和兴趣。做我们喜欢的事情可以帮助我们放松，让我们暂时忘记压力。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(180,'Additionally, it is important to maintain good relationships with family and friends. Having someone to talk to when we feel stressed can be very helpful.','此外，与家人和朋友保持良好的关系很重要。当我们感到压力时，有人可以倾诉会很有帮助。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(181,'When pressure becomes too overwhelming, we should not hesitate to seek professional help, such as consulting a psychologist.','当压力变得过于压倒性时，我们不应犹豫寻求专业帮助，如咨询心理学家。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(182,'In conclusion, pressure is inevitable in modern life, but we can learn to manage it effectively through a positive attitude, healthy lifestyle, and social support. By doing so, we can turn pressure into motivation and live a happier and healthier life.','总之，压力在现代生活中是不可避免的，但我们可以通过积极的态度、健康的生活方式和社交支持来有效管理它。通过这样做，我们可以将压力转化为动力，过上更快乐、更健康的生活。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(183,'It is widely acknowledged that reading books is of great importance to personal development.','人们普遍认为阅读书籍对个人发展非常重要。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(184,'Through reading, we can gain knowledge, broaden our horizons, and improve our thinking ability.','通过阅读，我们可以获取知识，拓宽视野，提高思维能力。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(185,'However, with the popularity of electronic devices like smartphones and tablets, many people, especially young people, are spending less time reading books and more time on digital entertainment.','然而，随着智能手机和平板电脑等电子设备的普及，许多人，尤其是年轻人，花在阅读书籍上的时间越来越少，而在数字娱乐上花费的时间越来越多。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(186,'This trend has raised concerns among educators and parents.','这一趋势引起了教育工作者和家长的担忧。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(187,'Some argue that digital media can also provide valuable information and may even be more engaging than traditional books.','有些人认为，数字媒体也可以提供有价值的信息，甚至可能比传统书籍更具吸引力。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(188,'However, I believe that reading traditional books is still irreplaceable and should be encouraged.','然而，我相信阅读传统书籍仍然是不可替代的，应该受到鼓励。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(189,'First of all, reading books helps to develop concentration and deep thinking. Unlike digital media which often provides fragmented and superficial information, books require readers to focus for longer periods and think deeply about the content.','首先，阅读书籍有助于培养专注力和深度思考能力。与数字媒体通常提供碎片化和肤浅的信息不同，书籍要求读者长时间集中注意力，深入思考内容。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(190,'Secondly, books, especially literary works, can enrich our emotional world and improve our empathy. Through reading about characters\' experiences and emotions, we can better understand human nature and develop compassion for others.','其次，书籍，尤其是文学作品，可以丰富我们的情感世界，提高我们的同理心。通过阅读人物的经历和情感，我们可以更好地理解人性，培养对他人的同情心。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(191,'Moreover, reading physical books is better for our eyes than staring at screens for long periods. It also provides a different sensory experience - the feel of paper pages, the smell of a new book - that digital media cannot replicate.','此外，阅读实体书籍对眼睛比长时间盯着屏幕要好。它还提供了一种不同的感官体验——纸张的触感，新书的气味——这是数字媒体无法复制的。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(192,'That said, I do not deny the benefits of digital media. They can provide quick access to information and make reading more convenient in some cases.','话虽如此，我并不否认数字媒体的好处。它们可以快速获取信息，在某些情况下使阅读更加方便。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(193,'However, we should not let them completely replace traditional reading. Instead, we should find a balance between digital and traditional reading.','然而，我们不应让它们完全取代传统阅读。相反，我们应该在数字阅读和传统阅读之间找到平衡。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(194,'Schools and parents should encourage children to develop a habit of reading books from an early age. Libraries should be better equipped and more accessible to the public.','学校和家长应该鼓励孩子从小养成阅读书籍的习惯。图书馆应该配备更好的设施，并对公众更开放。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(195,'In conclusion, reading traditional books remains an invaluable activity for personal growth and should be preserved in our increasingly digital world.','总之，在我们日益数字化的世界中，阅读传统书籍仍然是个人成长的宝贵活动，应该得到保留。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(196,'In today\'s fast-paced society, many people are concerned about the decreasing amount of leisure time.','在当今快节奏的社会中，许多人担心休闲时间的减少。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(197,'With the increasing demands of work and family responsibilities, many people find it difficult to find time for relaxation and hobbies.','随着工作和家庭责任要求的增加，许多人发现很难找到时间放松和培养爱好。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(198,'This trend has led to widespread stress and burnout among working adults.','这一趋势导致了工作成年人中广泛的压力和职业倦怠。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(199,'Some argue that this is an inevitable consequence of modernization and economic development.','一些人认为这是现代化和经济发展的必然结果。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(200,'They believe that as society progresses, people have to work harder to keep up with the pace of life and maintain their competitiveness.','他们认为，随着社会的进步，人们必须更加努力工作以跟上生活节奏并保持竞争力。','2025-11-18 16:40:59'),(201,'with the rapid development of economy','随着经济的快速发展','2025-11-23 17:26:20'),(202,'the remarkable improvement/ steady growth of people\'s living standard','人民生活水平的显著提高/稳步增长','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(203,'advanced science and technology','先进的科学技术','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(204,'be faced with new opportunities and challenges','面临新的机遇和挑战','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(205,'It is commonly believed/ recognized that...','人们普遍认为','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(206,'the inevitable result of social development','社会发展的必然结果','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(207,'arouse wide public concern/ draw public attention','引起了广泛的公众关注','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(208,'It is undeniable that.../ There is no denying that...','不可否认','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(209,'a heated discussion/ debate','热烈的讨论/争论','2025-11-23 17:26:21'),(210,'a controversial issue','有争议性的问题','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(211,'a totally different argument','完全不同的观点','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(212,'Some people...while others...','一些人...而另外一些人...','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(213,'As far as I am concerned,/ Personally,','就我而言/就个人而言','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(214,'reach an absolute consensus on...','就...达到绝对的一致','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(215,'be supported by sound reasons','有充分的理由支持','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(216,'argument on both sides','双方的论点','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(217,'play an increasingly important role in...','发挥着日益重要的作用','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(218,'be indispensable to...','对...必不可少','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(219,'As the proverb goes:','正如谚语所说','2025-11-23 17:26:22'),(220,'...be no exception','...也不例外','2025-11-23 17:26:23'),(221,'exert positive/ negative effects on...','对...产生有利/不利的影响','2025-11-23 17:26:23'),(222,'the advantages far outweigh the disadvantages.','利远远大于弊','2025-11-23 17:26:23'),(223,'lead to/ give rise to/ contribute to/ result in','导致，引起','2025-11-23 17:26:23'),(224,'a complicated social phenomenon','复杂的社会现象','2025-11-23 17:26:23'),(225,'sense of responsibility/ sense of achievement','责任感/成就感','2025-11-23 17:26:23'),(226,'s